  "h1": "Custom Polyester Seat Cushions for Bulk Orders",
  "metaTitle": "Custom Polyester Seat Cushions | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order custom polyester seat cushions in bulk for your brand. Durable, comfortable, and perfect for events. Get a quote at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>Polyester seat cushions offer a durable, low-maintenance option for bulk buyers who need reliable seating for events, trade shows, or employee breaks. Unlike foam or gel alternatives, polyester resists fading and mildew, making it ideal for outdoor use at company picnics or stadium giveaways. These cushions hold vibrant screen-printed or embroidered logos well, ensuring your brand stands out season after season. Choose from solid colors or two-tone designs like the Two-Tone Sherpa for added visual appeal.</p>",
